DESCRIPTION:Ray Lau  is a Cantonese American standup comedian. His style h
 as been praised by audiences for being unique\, relatable\, lighthearted\, 
 and playful. Ray’s most viral joke is about the “Chipotle Bean Scheme
 ” and has been seen millions of times. You can  often see him performing
  live across Southern California on the stages of Don’t Tell Comedy\, The
  Hollywood Improv\, Flappers\, and many more. His debut on the digital plat
 form Don’t Tell Comedy premieres this Summer.\n\nPlease note\, there is a
